\"Isa 20:5\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(23,20,5)\">Isa 20:5</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezek 32:30\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"32\" vBegin=\"30\" cEnd=\"32\" vEnd=\"30\" onclick=\"bcv(26,32,30)\">Ezek 32:30</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezek 36:32\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"36\" vBegin=\"32\" cEnd=\"36\" vEnd=\"32\" onclick=\"bcv(26,36,32)\">Ezek 36:32</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>3.</b> with object <bdbheb>בּשְׁתִּי לִשְׁאוֺל</bdbheb> <highlight>I am ashamed to ask</highlight> <checkingNeeded/><ref ref=\"Ezek 8:22\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(26,8,22)\">Ezek 8:22</ref> <bdbheb>לֹא</bdbheb> <bdbheb>תֵבשׁוּ תַּהְכְּרוּ לִי</bdbheb> <highlight>ye are not ashamed to deal hardly with me</highlight> (imperfect subject) <ref ref=\"Job 19:3\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(18,19,3)\">Job 19:3</ref>. <bdbheb>בּושׁ</bdbheb> often || <bdbheb>נכלם</bdbheb> &amp; <bdbheb>חפר</bdbheb>; <bdbheb>בּשׁוּ וְהָכְלְמוּ</bdbheb> <highlight>they are ashamed and confounded</highlight> <ref ref=\"Jer 14:3\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(24,14,3)\">Jer 14:3</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 22:22\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(24,22,22)\">Jer 22:22</ref> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Isa')\">Isa<sup>2</sup></lookup>, <ref ref=\"Isa 41:11\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"41\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"41\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(23,41,11)\">Isa 41:11</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 45:16\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"45\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"45\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(23,45,16)\">Isa 45:16</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 45:17\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"45\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"45\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(23,45,17)\">Isa 45:17</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezek 16:52\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"52\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"52\" onclick=\"bcv(26,16,52)\">Ezek 16:52</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezek 36:32\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"36\" vBegin=\"32\" cEnd=\"36\" vEnd=\"32\" onclick=\"bcv(26,36,32)\">Ezek 36:32</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 35:4\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"35\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"35\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(19,35,4)\">Ps 35:4</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 69:7\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"69\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"69\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(19,69,7)\">Ps 69:7</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezek 9:6\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(26,9,6)\">Ezek 9:6</ref> <bdbheb>וּבשׁוּ הַחֹזִים וְחָֽפְרוּ הַקֹּסְמִים</bdbheb> <highlight>and the seers shall be ashamed and the diviners confounded</highlight> <ref ref=\"Mic 3:7\" b=\"33\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(33,3,7)\">Mic 3:7</ref>, compare <ref ref=\"Jer 15:9\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(24,15,9)\">Jer 15:9</ref>; <ref ref=\"Job 6:20\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(18,6,20)\">Job 6:20</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 35:26\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"35\" vBegin=\"26\" cEnd=\"35\" vEnd=\"26\" onclick=\"bcv(19,35,26)\">Ps 35:26</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 40:15\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"40\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"40\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(19,40,15)\">Ps 40:15</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 70:3\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"70\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"70\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(19,70,3)\">Ps 70:3</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 71:24\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"71\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"71\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(19,71,24)\">Ps 71:24</ref> <bdbheb>יֵבוֺשׁ</bdbheb> <bdbheb>מְקוֺרוֺ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Hos 13:15\" b=\"28\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(28,13,15)\">Hos 13:15</ref> (read <bdbheb>יִיבַשׁ</bdbheb> <highlight>be dry</highlight>); <bdbheb>עַדבּֿוֺשׁ</bdbheb> <highlight>to the point of confusion</highlight> <ref ref=\"Judg 3:25\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"25\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"25\" onclick=\"bcv(7,3,25)\">Judg 3:25</ref> (compare GFM), <ref ref=\"2Kgs 2:17\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(12,2,17)\">2Kgs 2:17</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Kgs 8:11\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(12,8,11)\">2Kgs 8:11</ref>. <b>Polel</b> <highlight>Perfect</highlight> <bdbheb>בּשֵׁשׁ</bdbheb> <highlight>delay</highlight> (in shame), <bdbheb>בּשֵׁשׁ משֶׁה לָרֶדֶת</bdbheb> <highlight>Moses delayed to descend</highlight> <ref ref=\"Exod 32:1\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"32\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"32\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(2,32,1)\">Exod 32:1</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('J')\"><reflink>J</reflink></lookup>), <bdbheb>מַדּוּעַ בּשֵׁשׁ רִכְבּוֺ לָבוֺא</bdbheb> <highlight>why delay his chariots to come ?</highlight> <ref ref=\"Judg 5:28\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"28\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"28\" onclick=\"bcv(7,5,28)\">Judg 5:28</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>Hiph`il 1.</b> <bdbheb>הֱבִישׁוֺתָ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 44:8\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"44\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"44\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(19,44,8)\">Ps 44:8</ref> <bdbheb>הֱבִישֹׁתָה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 53:6\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"53\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"53\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(19,53,6)\">Ps 53:6</ref> <highlight>Imperfect</highlight> 2 masculine singular suffix <bdbheb>תְּבִישֵׁנִי</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 119:31\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"119\" vBegin=\"31\" cEnd=\"119\" vEnd=\"31\" onclick=\"bcv(19,119,31)\">Ps 119:31</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 119:116\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"119\" vBegin=\"116\" cEnd=\"119\" vEnd=\"116\" onclick=\"bcv(19,119,116)\">Ps 119:116</ref> <bdbheb>תָּבִישׁוּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 14:6\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(19,14,6)\">Ps 14:6</ref> <highlight>put to shame, Participle</highlight> <bdbheb>מֵבִישׁ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Prov 10:5\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(20,10,5)\">Prov 10:5</ref>; <ref ref=\"Prov 14:35\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"35\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"35\" onclick=\"bcv(20,14,35)\">Prov 14:35</ref>; <ref ref=\"Prov 19:26\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"26\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"26\" onclick=\"bcv(20,19,26)\">Prov 19:26</ref>; <